==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|тъчьнъ|alt=тъчьнъ, тъчьнꙑи}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*tъčьnъ}}. {{surf|ru|ты́кать|alt1=ты́кать, то́чка|-ный}}.

Compare typologically {{m+|de|pünktlich}} < {{m+|de|Punkt}} (<< {{m+|la|punctus}} (p.p.p. of {{m|la|pungō}}), whence also {{m+|en|point}}, {{m|en|punctual}}, {{m|ru|пунктуа́льный}}).

